    "detailed_description": "Want a cute little friend to keep you company during those long work or gaming sessions?<br>Pocket Waifu is your new adorable 3D chibi desktop companion! She'll hang out on your other monitor while you're working, or entertain you while you play other games! Adopt little Silvy and interact with her in various ways while she hangs out on your desktop. <br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br>\u2022 Achievements!<br>\u2022 Simple and easy to use UI<br>\u2022 Gorgeous 3D model and physics interactions<br>\u2022 Many settings options to customize your experience and performance optimizations. <br>\u2022 Over 80 unique animations and a variety of expressions, custom props, and foods.<br>\u2022 Compatible with all other games, software, and live wallpapers<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989820/extras/6ef20860f31f45a2bece502a3456d7a5.avif?t=1742668595\" width=600 height=85 /></span><br>Pat her head, boop her nose, or yeet her across your screen when she gets in your way!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989820/extras/a9ef5854d120ea9c794066a4a7418a77.poster.avif?t=1742668595\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989820/extras/a9ef5854d120ea9c794066a4a7418a77.webm?t=1742668595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989820/extras/f1c147b87fe0eff1ff6a1fdc0b83b126.avif?t=1742668595\" width=600 height=85 /></span><br>Play video games, ride a roomba across your screen, or dance to keep her entertained!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989820/extras/938d893952aa3a0a2fda0ff6bb9dbbd9.poster.avif?t=1742668595\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989820/extras/938d893952aa3a0a2fda0ff6bb9dbbd9.webm?t=1742668595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989820/extras/1361ae218a21b9074724b5315d0c316d.avif?t=1742668595\" width=600 height=85 /></span><br>Stream, clean the screen, catch bugs and mine minerals to earn money for food, gifts and upgrades!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989820/extras/021e23e05d9ef1a9c50f3c109dd84d06.poster.avif?t=1742668595\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989820/extras/021e23e05d9ef1a9c50f3c109dd84d06.webm?t=1742668595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989820/extras/00e8629d259319308e9e4c1e9ad7eaa8.avif?t=1742668595\" width=600 height=85 /></span><br>Come back everyday, pet her head, and make her discover new food to increase her affection for you!<br>When she loves you enough, she'll draw you a cute sketch and you'll unlock a gorgeous new background and new fun interactions!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989820/extras/9885a148ca88226d4d6d12e021350634.poster.avif?t=1742668595\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989820/extras/9885a148ca88226d4d6d12e021350634.webm?t=1742668595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><u><strong>Planned Features:</strong></u><br>\u2022  CHAOS MODE (she will be very disruptive in very fun ways!)<br>\u2022 More interactions<br>\u2022 More gaming and work activities<br>\u2022 Accessories, outfits, and customizations earned through gameplay<br>\u2022 To Do list and Pomodoro timer<br>\u2022 Other language translations",
    "about_the_game": "Want a cute little friend to keep you company during those long work or gaming sessions?<br>Pocket Waifu is your new adorable 3D chibi desktop companion! She'll hang out on your other monitor while you're working, or entertain you while you play other games! Adopt little Silvy and interact with her in various ways while she hangs out on your desktop. <br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br>\u2022 Achievements!<br>\u2022 Simple and easy to use UI<br>\u2022 Gorgeous 3D model and physics interactions<br>\u2022 Many settings options to customize your experience and performance optimizations. <br>\u2022 Over 80 unique animations and a variety of expressions, custom props, and foods.<br>\u2022 Compatible with all other games, software, and live wallpapers<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989820/extras/6ef20860f31f45a2bece502a3456d7a5.avif?t=1742668595\" width=600 height=85 /></span><br>Pat her head, boop her nose, or yeet her across your screen when she gets in your way!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989820/extras/a9ef5854d120ea9c794066a4a7418a77.poster.avif?t=1742668595\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989820/extras/a9ef5854d120ea9c794066a4a7418a77.webm?t=1742668595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989820/extras/f1c147b87fe0eff1ff6a1fdc0b83b126.avif?t=1742668595\" width=600 height=85 /></span><br>Play video games, ride a roomba across your screen, or dance to keep her entertained!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989820/extras/938d893952aa3a0a2fda0ff6bb9dbbd9.poster.avif?t=1742668595\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989820/extras/938d893952aa3a0a2fda0ff6bb9dbbd9.webm?t=1742668595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989820/extras/1361ae218a21b9074724b5315d0c316d.avif?t=1742668595\" width=600 height=85 /></span><br>Stream, clean the screen, catch bugs and mine minerals to earn money for food, gifts and upgrades!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989820/extras/021e23e05d9ef1a9c50f3c109dd84d06.poster.avif?t=1742668595\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989820/extras/021e23e05d9ef1a9c50f3c109dd84d06.webm?t=1742668595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989820/extras/00e8629d259319308e9e4c1e9ad7eaa8.avif?t=1742668595\" width=600 height=85 /></span><br>Come back everyday, pet her head, and make her discover new food to increase her affection for you!<br>When she loves you enough, she'll draw you a cute sketch and you'll unlock a gorgeous new background and new fun interactions!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989820/extras/9885a148ca88226d4d6d12e021350634.poster.avif?t=1742668595\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989820/extras/9885a148ca88226d4d6d12e021350634.webm?t=1742668595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><u><strong>Planned Features:</strong></u><br>\u2022  CHAOS MODE (she will be very disruptive in very fun ways!)<br>\u2022 More interactions<br>\u2022 More gaming and work activities<br>\u2022 Accessories, outfits, and customizations earned through gameplay<br>\u2022 To Do list and Pomodoro timer<br>\u2022 Other language translations",
